{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NBgWEZgLR1fAgx31QfECXF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  IRT person-fit provides a principled contamination detection framework at the\n  minimal-information operating point, with unique mechanistic interpretability\n  (θ-shift analysis, memorization fraction quantification, parametric null\n  distribution). While simpler statistics (HT) achieve comparable raw detection\n  power, lz* offers: (i) calibrated hypothesis testing via known null N(0,1),\n  (ii) Snijders correction for θ estimation error, (iii) full 4PL\n  item-heterogeneity weighting critical for multi-domain benchmarks like MMLU.\n  Post-RL robustness is demonstrated but shared across the person-fit family —\n  the structural immunity to distributional shifts is a class-level advantage\n  over log-prob methods. Claims soften from 'lz* uniquely robust' to\n  'person-fit family robust; lz* uniquely interpretable.'\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B × 4 conditions (0%-seed1/0%-seed2/15%/50%) × MMLU only.\n      Go/no-go 信号实验。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_seed1_lz_star: 8.5\n      clean_seed2_lz_star: 7.9\n      clean_mean: 8.2\n      clean_std: 0.42\n      contam_15_lz_star: 4.1\n      contam_50_lz_star: 7.0\n      delta_lz_star_15: -4.1\n      delta_lz_star_50: -1.2\n      cohens_d_contam15: -3.2\n      cohens_d_contam50: -1.1\n      contam_15_acc: 0.72\n      contam_50_acc: 0.76\n      memorization_fraction_15: 0.36\n      memorization_fraction_50: 0.28\n      seen_lz_star_15: 0.3\n      unseen_lz_star_15: 3.2\n      theta_shift_15: 0.25\n      theta_shift_50: 0.45\n      theta_fixed_contam15_lz: 11.5\n      theta_fixed_contam50_lz: 17.8\n      theta_fixed_ratio: 2.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Qwen 控制实验预期产生强效应但 free-θ 下 50% contamination 出现\n      non-monotonicity。Qwen baseline lz* 高 (~8-9) 因其 response pattern 与 4PL\n      预测高度一致但非完美匹配；15% 污染产生明显 aberrance（memorization fraction ~36%\n      意味着约 1/3 seen items 被记忆，产生 difficulty-inconsistent correct responses）。\n      50% 条件下 θ-shift 吸收大量 aberrance 信号导致 free-θ d 值下降至 ~1.1，但\n      θ-fixed 恢复单调性（ratio ~2.9）。这与 Qwen 高 baseline misfit (lz*~8.5)\n      交互——高 baseline 模型更容易出现 non-monotonicity 因为 θ 估计对 response\n      pattern 变化更敏感。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Qwen Pilot Controlled Contamination Results\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz_star, cohens_d, acc, theta_mle, lz_star_fixed, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [clean_s1, 8.5, 0, \"-\", 0.678, -0.10, \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [clean_s2, 7.9, 0, \"-\", 0.676, -0.11, \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, 4.1, -4.1, -3.2, 0.72, 0.15, 11.5, 0.36]\n          - [contam_50, 7.0, -1.2, -1.1, 0.76, 0.35, 17.8, 0.28]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: clean vs contam_15 vs contam_50 lz* (free-θ vs θ-fixed)\"\n      - \"Scatter: seen vs unseen item lz* contribution at 15% contamination\"\n    analysis: >\n      Go 信号确认。|d|>2 at 15% 足以支撑 Claim 1。Non-monotonicity 在 free-θ 下出现\n      是预期的，θ-fixed 恢复单调性是方法论贡献。Memorization fraction ~36% 与\n      SFT generalization 一致——QLoRA 仅记忆约 1/3 注入 items，其余通过泛化提升。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination (4 Families)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B + Llama-3.1-8B + Mistral-7B-v0.3 × 6 levels\n      (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × MMLU + GSM8K + HellaSwag。\n    expected_results:\n      n_families_validated: 3\n      qwen_mmlu_d15: -3.4\n      qwen_mmlu_d50: -1.0\n      llama_mmlu_d15: -2.9\n      llama_mmlu_d50: -3.3\n      mistral_mmlu_d15: -2.5\n      mistral_mmlu_d50: -3.0\n      gemma_mmlu_d15: -2.2\n      gemma_mmlu_d50: -2.8\n      gemma_note: \"Gemma 31B 参数量大，QLoRA 效率不同，可能需调参或 drop\"\n      gsm8k_avg_d15: -1.5\n      gsm8k_avg_d50: -2.0\n      hellaswag_avg_d15: -1.8\n      hellaswag_avg_d50: -2.5\n      cross_family_memo_frac_range: [0.30, 0.40]\n      cross_family_memo_frac_mean: 0.35\n      dose_response_monotonic_theta_fixed: true\n      dose_response_monotonic_free: \"model-dependent\"\n      n_conditions_total: 72\n      n_conditions_significant: 55\n      small_benchmark_weakness: \"GSM8K (1319 items) d ~1.5 at 15%, below MMLU\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 3/4 families 成功验证（n_families_validated=3）。Gemma-4-31B 因\n      参数量大且 QLoRA rank 可能不足，存在训练不稳定或效果弱化风险——median 档下 Gemma\n      可能仅提供 partial 结果或需 downgrade 为 supporting evidence。跨 benchmark\n      差异反映 n_items 效应（MMLU 14042 >> GSM8K 1319）——power theory 预测\n      GSM8K 在 15% 仅有 ~59% power，对应 d ~1.5。HellaSwag (10042 items) 介于两者\n      之间。Memorization fraction 跨家族一致 (~35%) 是 SFT 机制的稳定性质，\n      不依赖模型架构——QLoRA 的泛化模式相似因为都是 low-rank adaptation。Free-θ\n      non-monotonicity 仅出现在高 baseline lz* 模型（Qwen, Mistral），Llama\n      (baseline ~0) 保持单调。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Family Detection Summary (MMLU, θ-free)\"\n        columns: [family, clean_lz, d_5pct, d_10pct, d_15pct, d_25pct, d_50pct, memo_frac_15]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, 8.7, -0.8, -1.8, -3.4, -2.8, -1.0, 0.38]\n          - [Llama-8B, -0.1, -0.5, -1.5, -2.9, -3.1, -3.3, 0.35]\n          - [Mistral-7B, 5.4, -0.7, -1.6, -2.5, -2.8, -3.0, 0.34]\n          - [Gemma-31B, 3.2, -0.4, -1.0, -2.2, -2.5, -2.8, 0.32]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Detection (15% contamination, all families avg)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, avg_d, power_theory, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, -2.8, 0.979, 0.35]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, -1.8, 0.753, 0.33]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, -1.5, 0.591, 0.30]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: family × contamination_level → Cohen's d\"\n      - \"Dose-response curves: 4 families, free-θ vs θ-fixed\"\n      - \"Cross-benchmark power comparison with theory overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      3 families 足以支撑跨家族泛化 claim。Gemma 若部分失败，以 footnote 说明参数量/\n      QLoRA 差异。n_items 效应与 power theory 一致——这本身强化 Claim 2。Memorization\n      fraction 跨家族一致性 (3pp 差异) 是关键发现，支撑 SFT 泛化机制的普适性。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit (ABANDONED)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描。已因 MML-EM refit 失败 (a_r=0.111)\n      而放弃。\n    expected_results:\n      status: ABANDONED\n      reason: \"a_r=0.111 discrimination failure makes v1-refit IRT parameters unreliable\"\n      data_availability_noted: true\n      n_models_available: 13000+\n      future_work_mention: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下此实验不执行。MML-EM 从 N=63→178 模型重拟合 IRT 参数，discrimination\n      参数 a_r=0.111 远低于 0.2 阈值——经典 IRT 拟合方法在 LLM 数据上失效因为：\n      (1) 样本量仍不足（经典 IRT 需 N>500），(2) LLM response pattern 违反 local\n      independence（同 domain items 相关），(3) 模型能力分布与 IRT 假设不匹配。\n      13K+ 数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work 作为 scaling roadmap。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      放弃是正确决定。论文中将 refit 失败作为 methodological caveat (Claim 3c)\n      展示——量化经典 IRT 与 neural IRT 估计的 sample size gap。\n\n  - name: \"Natural Experiment (v1 base→chat pairs)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-natural-experiment\"\n    description: >\n      v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 的 Δlz* 作为 SFT 效应代理。P2-optional。\n    expected_results:\n      n_pairs: 21\n      n_complete_pairs: 9\n      significant_benchmarks: 2\n      hellaswag_mean_deviation: -3.4\n      hellaswag_p: 0.001\n      gsm8k_mean_deviation: 3.9\n      gsm8k_p: 0.009\n      mmlu_p: 0.15\n      arcc_p: 0.38\n      individual_outliers: 0\n      interpretation: \"systematic SFT effects, not contamination-specific\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 显示系统性 SFT 效应（方向一致的 Δlz* shift）\n      但无个体 pair 出现 benchmark-specific 异常。这是因为 chat 模型的 SFT 训练\n      普遍改变了 response pattern——HellaSwag (commonsense) 受 instruction tuning\n      负面影响（降低 person-fit），GSM8K (math) 受益（提高 person-fit）。但用\n      a_r=0.111 的 refit 参数计算的 lz* 本质上退化为 accuracy-like 指标，无法\n      区分 contamination 与 legitimate SFT improvement。仅 9 个 complete pairs\n      缺乏统计检验力做细粒度分析。作为 P2 supplementary evidence 足够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Natural Experiment SFT Effects\"\n        columns: [benchmark, mean_delta_lz, t_stat, p_value, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [HellaSwag, -3.4, -3.97, 0.001, \"SFT decreases person-fit\"]\n          - [GSM8K, +3.9, 3.35, 0.009, \"SFT increases person-fit\"]\n          - [MMLU, \"+1.2\", 1.54, 0.15, \"n.s.\"]\n          - [ARC-C, \"-0.8\", -0.91, 0.38, \"n.s.\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per benchmark (9 complete pairs)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supplementary evidence only。系统性 SFT 方向差异 (HellaSwag↓, GSM8K↑) 有趣\n      但因 refit 参数质量问题不做强 claim。P2 降级合理。\n\n  - name: \"v1 IRT Refit Expanded (N≥500)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\"\n    description: >\n      扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥500，最终关闭 Path D。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_downloaded: 178\n      a_pearson_r_3pl: 0.127\n      a_pearson_r_2pl: -0.029\n      b_pearson_r_3pl: 0.663\n      conclusion: \"Path D dead — discrimination failure persists at N=178\"\n      threshold_met: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 N=178 仍无法恢复 discrimination 参数（a_r=0.127, 远低于 0.4\n      可行阈值）。根本原因不是样本量而是经典 MML-EM 拟合方法的结构性限制：\n      (1) LLM response pattern 不满足 local independence——同 domain 1000+ items\n      高度相关，(2) 能力维度 θ 对 LLM 而言不是单一维度——不同 benchmark 需要不同\n      \"能力\"，(3) N=178 模型虽多于 pilot 的 63，但 item 数 14042 远超模型数，\n      导致 over-determined 系统。b_r=0.663 部分成功因为 difficulty 与 accuracy\n      线性相关——即使模型不多也能恢复。a (discrimination) 需要建模 item 间差异化\n      响应概率的曲率，这需要更多分布覆盖。Path D 确认关闭。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: IRT Refit Parameter Recovery\"\n        columns: [method, n_models, a_r, b_r, conclusion]\n        rows:\n          - [3PL pilot, 63, 0.111, 0.626, \"dead\"]\n          - [3PL expanded, 178, 0.127, 0.663, \"dead\"]\n          - [2PL expanded, 178, -0.029, 0.572, \"dead\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Path D 最终关闭。论文 Claim 3c 中作为 methodological caveat 展示。\n      关键贡献：量化经典 IRT 与 LLM context 的 sample size gap。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      4PL vs 3PL(d=1) ablation——量化 feasibility parameter d 对检测的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      far_4pl: 0.05\n      far_3pl: \"4.7-16.5%\"\n      far_2pl: \"50-100%\"\n      mean_power_gain_mmlu: \"+27pp\"\n      mean_power_gain_hellaswag: \"+26pp\"\n      mean_power_gain_gsm8k: \"+20pp\"\n      items_with_d_lt_0.95_mmlu: \"46%\"\n      max_power_gain: \"+59pp (HellaSwag)\"\n      deepseek_v3_delta: 357\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 4PL d 参数对检测至关重要。46% MMLU items 有 d<0.95——这些 items\n      的 upper asymptote 低于 1.0，意味着即使能力极高的模型也无法以 100% 概率答对。\n      忽略 d (设 d=1) 使得 4PL 模型对高能力模型的预测概率系统性偏高，产生虚假\n      aberrance 信号——高能力模型答错一个 d=0.8 的 item 是正常的，但 3PL 认为是\n      异常。结果：(1) 3PL FAR 膨胀至 4.7-16.5%（benchmark 依赖），(2) detection\n      power 平均下降 20-27pp 因为 noise floor 升高，(3) 2PL 更灾难性（FAR 50-100%）\n      因为同时忽略了 guessing parameter c。power gain 在 d<0.8 bucket 最大\n      (+6.8 to +61.2pp)，d≥0.95 时 gain 可忽略。这证明 PSN-IRT 的 4PL 参数化对\n      LLM contamination detection 而非 academic nicety 是必要的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power (25% contamination)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, power_4pl, power_3pl, gain, pct_items_d_lt_0.95]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.776, 0.329, \"+44.7pp\", \"46%\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.534, 0.280, \"+25.4pp\", \"38%\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.730, 0.334, \"+39.6pp\", \"42%\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.132, 0.091, \"+4.1pp\", \"28%\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.318, 0.165, \"+15.3pp\", \"35%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side power curves: 4PL vs 3PL across contamination levels\"\n      - \"Scatter: d parameter value vs power gain per item bucket\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL 对 LLM 应用必要性的强证据。回应 R8 reviewer concern。结论：使用 3PL\n      会丢失约一半检测力。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison (≥5 baselines)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在控制实验 ground-truth contaminated models 上比较 IRT-FIT vs ≥5 baselines。\n      包括 ConStat (retest), Min-K%++ (token probs), acc z-score, HT, Guttman/U3。\n    expected_results:\n      model_level_lz_star_d_qwen15: -3.42\n      model_level_ht_d_qwen15: -3.21\n      model_level_guttman_d_qwen15: -0.43\n      model_level_u3_d_qwen15: -0.38\n      model_level_acc_zscore: 160.6\n      ht_vs_lz_star_ratio: 0.94\n      lz_star_vs_guttman_ratio: 8.0\n      constat_retest_auroc: 0.78\n      mink_sft_auroc: 0.60\n      item_level_max_auroc: 0.63\n      item_level_lz_itemwise_auroc: 0.536\n      item_level_irt_residual_auroc: 0.582\n      item_level_lr_cross_auroc: 0.592\n      item_level_rf_oracle_auroc: 0.63\n      n_baselines_beaten: 4\n      n_baselines_total: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心发现：HT 与 lz* 在 model-level detection 上差距很小\n      (d ratio ~0.94)——HT 仅需 item difficulty，无需完整 4PL 参数化，却达到\n      comparable 效果。这是因为 model-level aggregation 对 14K items 的 central\n      limit theorem 效应使得 item-level 参数权重差异被平均掉——HT 的 uniform\n      weighting 与 lz* 的 a-weighted 方案在大 n 下收敛。lz* vs Guttman/U3 的 8×\n      差距证明 IRT 框架（含 difficulty ordering）优于纯 response pattern 统计。\n      ConStat retest AUROC=0.78 有效但需额外推理轮次（更多信息），符合 detection\n      frontier 叙事。Min-K%++ 在 SFT 上 AUROC=0.60（弱），因为 SFT 改变了 token\n      分布但未产生 memorization-specific 的 perplexity 异常——SFT 后模型对\n      contaminated items 的 logprob 分布与 generalization 难以区分。Item-level\n      所有方法 near-random (max 0.63 with oracle) 因为 memorization fraction ~35%\n      意味着仅 1/3 items 产生可检测信号——这种 diffuse signature 只能通过\n      model-level aggregation 检测。acc z-score 的 z=160 说明它在 controlled\n      setting 下 trivially 有效但无法在 real-world 中区分 contamination 与\n      legitimate high ability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Model-Level Baseline Comparison (Qwen 15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [method, info_required, cohens_d, requires_retest, interpretable]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz* (ours)\", \"binary + 4PL params\", -3.42, \"No\", \"Yes (θ-shift, memo frac)\"]\n          - [\"HT\", \"binary + item difficulty\", -3.21, \"No\", \"Limited\"]\n          - [\"Guttman\", \"binary only\", -0.43, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"U3\", \"binary only\", -0.38, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"acc z-score\", \"binary + population stats\", -160.6, \"No\", \"No (specificity issue)\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"binary + retest\", \"AUROC=0.78\", \"Yes\", \"Partial\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"token probabilities\", \"AUROC=0.60\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Item-Level Detection (all methods near-random)\"\n        columns: [method, auroc_qwen15, auroc_qwen50, auroc_llama15, auroc_llama50]\n        rows:\n          - [lz_itemwise, 0.536, 0.535, 0.528, 0.536]\n          - [irt_residual, 0.578, 0.563, 0.582, 0.581]\n          - [lr_cross_model, 0.586, 0.567, 0.592, 0.585]\n          - [rf_oracle, 0.610, 0.630, 0.615, 0.629]\n          - [random, 0.500, 0.500, 0.500, 0.500]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detection frontier diagram: methods ranked by information access vs detection power\"\n      - \"Bar chart: model-level Cohen's d across all baselines\"\n      - \"ROC curves: item-level detection (all near diagonal)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档叙事转向：lz* 的优势不在 raw detection power（HT comparable）而在\n      interpretability 和 framework contribution。n_baselines_beaten=4 (Guttman,\n      U3, Min-K++, random)。HT comparable 但缺乏 parametric null, Snijders\n      correction, 4PL weighting——这些在 MMLU 57 subjects 异质性大时理论上更精确。\n      ConStat 有效但需 retest (更多信息)。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Aggregation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合的\n      标准化 lz* 总分。\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_gemini15: 45.2\n      lzm_deepseek_v3: 38.7\n      lzm_qwen_plus: 35.1\n      lzm_doubao: -18.3\n      lzm_mistral: 12.4\n      lzm_correlation_with_max_lz: 0.92\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_clean: 12.8\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15: 6.5\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_50: 9.2\n      added_value_over_per_benchmark: \"marginal\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 lzm 提供 per-model 的单一污染严重度指标，但 added value 有限。\n      lzm 本质是各 benchmark lz* 的 variance-weighted sum——由于 MMLU lz* 已经\n      dominate (n=14042 产生最极端值)，lzm 高度相关于 max per-benchmark lz*\n      (r=0.92)。在 PSN-IRT 12-model data 上，lzm 重现已知排序（Gemini-1.5 最高）。\n      在 ctrl-contam 上，因为只有 MMLU 数据，lzm 退化为 lz* itself。理论贡献：\n      展示 Hong et al. 公式对 LLM multi-benchmark 评估的适用性。但 median 档下\n      不产生 new insight——P2 优先级合理。若 full ctrl-contam 覆盖 3 benchmarks，\n      lzm 可显示跨 benchmark aggregation 的 marginal gain。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm vs max-benchmark lz* (PSN-IRT 12 models)\"\n        columns: [model, lzm, max_lz_star, dominant_benchmark]\n        rows:\n          - [Gemini-1.5, 45.2, 31.8, MMLU]\n          - [DeepSeek-V3, 38.7, 25.3, MMLU]\n          - [Qwen-Plus, 35.1, 24.5, MMLU]\n          - [Doubao-Pro, -18.3, -15.2, HellaSwag]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: lzm vs max per-benchmark lz* (high correlation)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix material。lzm 在当前数据条件下不改变结论。未来若覆盖更多 benchmarks\n      且有 cross-benchmark differential contamination，lzm 可显示独立价值。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Hypothesis Test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 是否在 RL 后保持检测力。\n    expected_results:\n      post_rl_lz_star_cohens_d: 1.5\n      post_rl_ht_cohens_d: 1.3\n      post_rl_mia_auroc: 0.52\n      post_rl_mink_auroc: 0.51\n      pre_rl_lz_star_d: -3.42\n      signal_retention_lz: 0.44\n      signal_retention_ht: 0.40\n      rl_steps: 2000\n      reward_type: \"rule-based (accuracy on held-out)\"\n      delta_lz_pre_rl: -4.84\n      delta_lz_post_rl: -2.1\n      delta_ht_post_rl: -1.8\n      theta_shift_post_rl: 0.35\n      acc_post_rl: 0.74\n      acc_seen_post_rl: 0.70\n      acc_unseen_post_rl: 0.68\n      memo_frac_post_rl: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：post-RL signal partially degrades for ALL person-fit methods。\n      GRPO 优化使模型学会\"推理\"而非\"记忆\"——RL 的 reward signal 鼓励 generalizable\n      reasoning patterns，这部分平滑了 SFT 注入的 memorization fingerprint。\n      具体机制：(1) memorization fraction 从 ~38% 降至 ~12%——RL 使模型对 seen\n      items 的回答方式从 rote recall 转向 reasoning-based，部分 items 不再产生\n      difficulty-inconsistent response；(2) θ 进一步上升（RL 提升整体能力），吸收\n      更多 aberrance；(3) 但 ~12% items 仍保留 memorization signature——这些是\n      factual knowledge items 无法通过推理路径解答，只能靠记忆。lz* d=1.5 和 HT\n      d=1.3 均在 [1.0, 2.0] 范围内——detectable 但 effect size 明显弱于 pre-RL。\n      两者退化幅度相似（signal_retention ~40-44%），说明 RL-induced degradation\n      作用于 response pattern level（person-fit 家族共享），非统计量特异性。MIA/\n      Min-K++ AUROC ~0.51-0.52（near random）符合 Wang et al. 发现——log-prob\n      方法在 RL 后完全失效，而 person-fit 保留 partial signal。这是 person-fit\n      作为 family 的 structural advantage，但无法 differentiate lz* vs HT。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Detection Power Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, pre_rl_d, post_rl_d, retention, info_level]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz*\", -3.42, -1.5, \"44%\", \"binary + 4PL\"]\n          - [\"HT\", -3.21, -1.3, \"40%\", \"binary + difficulty\"]\n          - [\"Guttman\", -0.43, -0.20, \"47%\", \"binary only\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"AUROC=0.60\", \"AUROC=0.51\", \"~random\", \"token probs\"]\n          - [\"MIA-loss\", \"AUROC=0.59\", \"AUROC=0.52\", \"~random\", \"token probs\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Memorization Fraction Degradation\"\n        columns: [stage, memo_frac, lz_star, delta_lz, cohens_d]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, \"-\", 8.68, 0, \"-\"]\n          - [post-SFT (15%), 0.38, 3.85, -4.84, -3.42]\n          - [post-RL, 0.12, 6.58, -2.10, -1.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-stage waterfall: clean → SFT-contaminated → post-RL lz* trajectory\"\n      - \"Bar chart: person-fit family vs log-prob family post-RL retention\"\n      - \"Seen/unseen accuracy gap: pre-RL vs post-RL (gap narrows)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档叙事策略：(1) person-fit FAMILY 在 post-RL 保留 detectable signal\n      (d>1.0)，log-prob 方法完全失效——class-level advantage 确认；(2) lz* 与 HT\n      退化幅度相似，无法 empirically differentiate——转用数据无关差异化论证\n      (parametric null, Snijders correction, 4PL weighting)；(3) memorization\n      fraction 从 38%→12% 量化了 RL 的 \"washing\" 效应——这本身是对 RL alignment\n      文献的贡献（RL 部分消除 SFT contamination）；(4) 论文 claim 从 \"lz* uniquely\n      robust\" 软化为 \"person-fit family robust; lz* uniquely interpretable\"。\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 benchmark 覆盖：BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充\n      1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_4pl_available: false\n      math_4pl_available: false\n      bbh_2pl_refit_attempted: true\n      bbh_a_r: 0.15\n      math_a_r: 0.12\n      bbh_power_15pct_sim: 0.68\n      math_power_15pct_sim: 0.62\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_d15: -1.8\n      math_ctrl_contam_d15: -1.2\n      power_gap_filled: \"partial\"\n      n_items_range_covered: \"1319 (GSM8K) → 6511 (BBH) → 10042 (HellaSwag) → 14042 (MMLU)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 PSN-IRT 不包含 BBH/MATH 的 4PL 参数——需自行拟合。但自行\n      拟合面临与 v1-refit 相同的问题：discrimination recovery 弱 (a_r ~0.12-0.15)。\n      Workaround：(1) 仅用 simulation（假设合理 4PL 参数分布）预测 power——\n      BBH 6511 items 在 15% 时 power ~68%（power theory R²=0.957 插值），\n      MATH 5000 items ~62%；(2) 如果有 ctrl-contam 数据，用 PSN-IRT MMLU 参数\n      的 distributional statistics 生成 synthetic 4PL 参数估计。Ctrl-contam 实际\n      d 值偏低 (BBH d ~1.8, MATH d ~1.2) 因为拟合参数质量不如 PSN-IRT——但仍\n      在 detectable 范围。填充 power gap 是 partial 的：power theory 插值有效，\n      但缺乏 ground-truth 4PL 参数的直接验证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Function Validation Across Benchmark Sizes\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, power_theory_15pct, power_sim_15pct, power_ctrl_d15]\n        rows:\n          - [ARC-C, 295, 0.129, 0.129, \"0.5-1.5 (θ-fixed)\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.591, 0.591, \"-1.5\"]\n          - [MATH, 5000, 0.62, \"~0.62 (sim)\", \"-1.2\"]\n          - [BBH, 6511, 0.68, \"~0.68 (sim)\", \"-1.8\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.753, 0.753, \"-1.8\"]\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.979, 0.979, \"-3.4\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve with BBH/MATH points added (theory overlay)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Partial contribution。Power theory 插值验证有效但缺乏 PSN-IRT 级别的 4PL\n      ground truth。若 PSN-IRT authors 有 BBH/MATH 参数可协作获取——否则仅报告\n      simulation-based 预测。P2 优先级合理——非论文核心但强化 Claim 2。\n\n  - name: \"Domain-Level Analysis (MMLU subjects)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别污染的 domain 分布模式。\n    expected_results:\n      gemini_accuracy: 1.0\n      gemini_subjects_flagged: \"50/57\"\n      gemini_domain_concentrated: false\n      gemini_stem_lz: 21.2\n      gemini_humanities_lz: 17.9\n      gemini_social_sciences_lz: 15.9\n      gemini_other_lz: 15.3\n      doubao_negative_lz: true\n      doubao_stem_lz: -2.0\n      doubao_humanities_lz: -13.0\n      doubao_social_sciences_lz: -14.8\n      ctrl_contam_domain_uniform: true\n      ctrl_contam_seen_unseen_per_domain: \"consistent across domains\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 domain analysis 确认两种 contamination 模式：(1) Gemini-1.5\n      的 uniform 高 lz* 横跨 50/57 subjects——全面 contamination 或极高能力\n      (acc=100%)，无法区分但 domain 均匀性本身是 pattern；(2) Doubao 的 selective\n      negative lz*——Humanities/Social Sciences 显示强 negative aberrance\n      (lz* -13 to -15)，暗示这些 domains 的 training data 与 MMLU item\n      distribution 不匹配（答对 hard items 但答错 easy items）。STEM 相对正常\n      因为 STEM 训练数据覆盖更广。ctrl-contam (QLoRA) 注入的 items 按 random\n      15% 采样，因此 domain 分布预期 uniform——验证实验设计的内部一致性。\n      Domain-level 分析的附加价值：为 future auditors 提供 \"contamination\n      fingerprinting\" 工具——selective domain contamination 暗示 targeted training。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Domain-Level lz* Profile (Selected Models)\"\n        columns: [model, STEM, Humanities, Social_Sci, Other, pattern]\n        rows:\n          - [Gemini-1.5, 21.2, 17.9, 15.9, 15.3, \"uniform high\"]\n          - [Doubao-Pro, -2.0, -13.0, -14.8, 4.4, \"selective negative\"]\n          - [Hunyuan-Large, 1.8, 8.5, 13.9, 6.2, \"social science high\"]\n          - [Yi-Lightning, 48.2, 35.1, 42.5, 38.9, \"uniform extreme\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: model × MMLU domain → lz* (4 categories)\"\n      - \"Radar chart: Gemini vs Doubao domain profiles\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix or §5.3 subsection。Domain-level 分析支撑 Claim 3b (anomaly\n      profiles)。Selective vs uniform 模式为 contamination typology 提供\n      mechanistic insight。\n\n  - name: \"ConStat Comparison (Retest-Based)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      ConStat (NeurIPS 2024) retest-based comparison on ctrl-contam models。\n      Part of baseline comparison but requiring additional inference runs。\n    expected_results:\n      constat_retest_auroc: 0.78\n      constat_n_retests: 3\n      constat_gpu_hours: 8\n      constat_vs_lz_star_at_model_level: \"comparable detection\"\n      constat_information_cost: \"3× inference budget\"\n      constat_specificity: \"higher than acc z-score\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 ConStat 在 model-level 检测上 AUROC=0.78——有效但不如 lz*\n      的 d=3.4 直接。ConStat 的 retest 设计需要 rephrased items 和多次推理，\n      本质上是用\"更多信息\"换取\"更确定的判断\"。AUROC 0.78 而非更高是因为：\n      (1) QLoRA SFT 的 memorization 是 partial (~35%)——rephrased items 的\n      response 变化不如 verbatim 记忆那么 dramatic；(2) SFT 泛化效应使得部分\n      seen items 即使 rephrased 也答对——这降低了 retest 的 sensitivity。\n      关键对比：lz* 用 zero 额外推理达到 comparable 检测力——这是 minimal-information\n      operating point 的核心价值。ConStat 在 detection frontier 上位于 \"binary\n      + retest\" 层级，高于 lz* 的 \"binary only\" 但低于 \"token probs\" 层级。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Integrated into baseline comparison table。ConStat 结果强化 detection\n      frontier 叙事——更多信息确实有帮助但 marginal gain 不大。\n\n  - name: \"MIA/Min-K++ on SFT Contamination\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      Min-K%++ 和 MIA-loss 在 SFT-contaminated 模型上的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      mink_sft_auroc: 0.61\n      mia_loss_sft_auroc: 0.59\n      mink_base_auroc: 0.49\n      mia_loss_base_auroc: 0.49\n      mink_post_rl_auroc: 0.51\n      interpretation: \"SFT produces weak token-level signal, RL washes it\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 Min-K%++ 在 SFT contamination 上 AUROC=0.61——高于 random\n      但远低于 lz* 的 model-level detection (d=3.4)。SFT 确实在 token-level\n      留下微弱信号（seen items 的 perplexity 略低），但 QLoRA 的 low-rank\n      constraint 限制了 memorization 精度——模型学到的是 \"pattern-level\" 而非\n      \"token-level\" 的记忆，导致 Min-K%++ 这种依赖 token-level anomaly 的\n      方法效果有限。这与 MIA-loss 类似 (AUROC=0.59)——两者本质上测量同一信号\n      (token probability anomaly) 的不同 summary。Base model (未 SFT) 上两者\n      ~random (0.49) 因为没有 memorization 信号。Post-RL 时 AUROC 回到 ~0.51\n      (near random)——RL 的 distributional shift 完全掩盖了残余的 token-level\n      signal，与 Wang et al. (2025) 一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Token-Level Methods Across Training Stages\"\n        columns: [method, base_auroc, sft_auroc, post_rl_auroc]\n        rows:\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.49, 0.61, 0.51]\n          - [MIA-loss, 0.49, 0.59, 0.52]\n          - [PPL-based, 0.50, 0.56, 0.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curves: Min-K++/MIA across training stages\"\n    analysis: >\n      Confirms binary-only person-fit is NOT inferior to token-prob methods\n      for SFT contamination。Token methods' weakness validates the\n      minimal-information framing——more information (token probs) doesn't\n      necessarily help when the contamination mechanism is SFT-style.\n\n  - name: \"ARC-C Benchmark Validation (Small Benchmark)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      ARC-Challenge (295 items) 上的控制实验——验证 small benchmark 检测极限。\n    expected_results:\n      arcc_clean_lz: -5.5\n      arcc_contam15_lz: -4.9\n      arcc_contam50_lz: -4.6\n      arcc_delta_lz_15: 0.6\n      arcc_delta_lz_50: 0.9\n      arcc_cohens_d_15_free: -0.5\n      arcc_cohens_d_50_free: -0.8\n      arcc_theta_fixed_d_15: 0.8\n      arcc_theta_fixed_d_50: 1.2\n      arcc_power_theory_15: 0.129\n      arcc_memo_frac: 0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 ARC-C (295 items) 在 free-θ 下检测力很弱 (d ~0.5 at 15%)\n      因为 power theory 预测仅 12.9% power。295 items 的 lz* 方差大——noise\n      floor 高导致 signal/noise ratio 低。θ-fixed 改善至 d ~0.8-1.2 因为消除了\n      θ-shift confound，但仍远低于 MMLU 的 d=3.4。Memorization fraction ~30%\n      意味着 15% contamination 仅 ~44 items 被记忆——在 295 items 中产生的\n      pattern distortion 不够大。这与 power theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power\n      =7958 一致——ARC-C 远低于此阈值。θ-fixed analysis 的 arcc_theta_fixed_d\n      在 [0.5, 1.5] 范围内——detectable 但效应弱。这是一个\"honest characterization\"\n      而非限制——小 benchmark 的检测力弱是信息论预期。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ARC-C Detection (Small Benchmark Regime)\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, d_free, d_theta_fixed]\n        rows:\n          - [clean (mean), -5.5, 0, \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, -4.9, 0.6, -0.5, 0.8]\n          - [contam_50, -4.6, 0.9, -0.8, 1.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve with ARC-C highlighted as 'small benchmark regime'\"\n    analysis: >\n      ARC-C 结果验证 power theory 预测——小 benchmark 检测力弱是理论预期。\n      θ-fixed 部分补偿但不改变根本限制。论文中作为 Claim 2 的支撑证据——\n      detection power 与 n_items 的关系在实际数据中得到验证。\n\n  - name: \"HT vs lz* Post-RL Differentiation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Post-RL 条件下 HT 与 lz* 的 differential robustness 测试。\n    expected_results:\n      lz_star_post_rl_d: 1.5\n      ht_post_rl_d: 1.3\n      lz_star_ht_ratio_post_rl: 1.15\n      lz_star_ht_ratio_pre_rl: 1.07\n      differentiation_significant: false\n      differentiation_p_value: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心预期：lz* 和 HT post-RL 退化幅度相似，差异不显著 (p=0.35)。\n      ratio 从 pre-RL 1.07 微升至 1.15——lz* 略好但 n=1 (单一模型) 条件下无法\n      得出统计结论。原因：post-RL 的 signal degradation 作用于 response pattern\n      level——RL 改变了模型对 items 的作答方式（从记忆转向推理），这一变化对所有\n      基于 response pattern 的统计量影响相似。lz* 的 4PL weighting 在 large n\n      (14K items) 下的优势被 RL-induced noise 部分抵消。HT 的 robustness 来自其\n      simplicity——仅依赖 difficulty ordering，RL 对 difficulty ordering 的扰动\n      较小。结论：无法通过 post-RL 实验 empirically differentiate lz* vs HT——\n      转用数据无关差异化策略。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lz* vs HT Post-RL Comparison\"\n        columns: [statistic, pre_rl_d, post_rl_d, retention, ratio_lz_over_ht]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz*\", -3.42, -1.50, \"44%\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"HT\", -3.21, -1.30, \"40%\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"ratio\", 1.07, 1.15, \"-\", \"n.s. (p=0.35)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: lz* vs HT pre/post-RL with error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档叙事应对（对应 R12 reviewer concern）：empirical differentiation\n      失败 → 激活数据无关差异化三论证：(i) parametric null N(0,1)——bootstrap\n      已验证 lz* null 分布 mean=0.09/std=1.00，HT 无此性质，需 per-case bootstrap；\n      (ii) Snijders correction Var*=Var_l - C²/I(θ) 补偿 θ 估计误差——尤其在\n      θ-fixed 不可用时 (e.g., retrospective audit without clean baseline)；\n      (iii) 4PL a-weighting 在 MMLU 57 subjects 高异质性下理论更精确——虽然\n      empirical d 差异不显著，但信息论上 lz* 使用了更多 item-level information。\n      论文应坦诚报告并将这些论证置于 Discussion §6。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral n=1 Supporting Evidence\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 单 clean seed 控制实验——作为第三个 family 的 supporting\n      evidence。\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_clean_lz: 5.42\n      mistral_contam15_lz: -1.38\n      mistral_contam50_lz: -3.15\n      mistral_delta_lz_15: -6.80\n      mistral_delta_lz_50: -8.57\n      mistral_acc_clean: 0.514\n      mistral_contam15_acc: 0.595\n      mistral_memo_frac_15: 0.34\n      mistral_n_clean_seeds: 1\n      mistral_cohens_d_estimate: \"N/A (n=1, no variance estimate)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档 Mistral 仅 n=1 clean seed——无法计算 Cohen's d 或 CI。但\n      Δlz*=-6.80 (15%) 的绝对值比 Qwen (-4.84) 和 Llama (-2.85) 更大，因为\n      Mistral 是最弱模型 (acc=0.514)——低能力模型受 contamination 的 response\n      pattern distortion 更大（baseline 答错很多 items，contamination 后这些\n      items 突然答对，产生更极端的 aberrance）。Mistral baseline lz*=5.42\n      (正值) 意味着 clean model 已经 slightly over-consistent——contamination\n      后 lz* 翻转至负值 (-1.38) 说明 aberrance signal 足够强。作为 n=1\n      supporting evidence 而非 primary validation——论文中明确标注 \"single-seed,\n      indicative\"。跨三个 family (Qwen/Llama/Mistral) 的 detection success\n      足以支撑 n_families_validated=3。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Mistral Supporting Evidence (n=1)\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, acc, theta, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, 5.42, 0, 0.514, -1.157, \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, -1.38, -6.80, 0.595, -0.713, 0.34]\n          - [contam_50, -3.15, -8.57, 0.673, -0.303, 0.29]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-family Δlz* comparison: Qwen vs Llama vs Mistral (indicating n=1 for Mistral)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supporting evidence。n=1 不支持独立 claim 但与 Qwen/Llama 一致的方向性\n      结果增强跨家族泛化叙事。注意 Mistral 的 Δlz* 绝对值更大反映的是低能力\n      模型的更强 contamination signal——与 power theory 一致（低 θ baseline\n      → 更大 response pattern shift）。\n\n  - name: \"Full Baseline Comparison Table (Frontier Ranking)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      Detection frontier 完整排名表——所有方法按信息访问层级排列。\n    expected_results:\n      n_baselines_total: 7\n      n_baselines_beaten_at_model_level: 4\n      frontier_ranking:\n        binary_only: [\"Guttman (d=0.43)\", \"U3 (d=0.38)\", \"random (d=0)\"]\n        binary_plus_difficulty: [\"HT (d=3.21)\"]\n        binary_plus_4pl: [\"lz* (d=3.42)\"]\n        binary_plus_retest: [\"ConStat (AUROC=0.78)\"]\n        token_probs: [\"Min-K%++ (AUROC=0.61)\", \"MIA-loss (AUROC=0.59)\"]\n      key_comparison: \"person-fit family (HT + lz*) >> pure binary (Guttman/U3) >> token-prob (Min-K++)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档 frontier ranking 清晰呈现信息层级与检测力的关系：(1) 纯 binary\n      (Guttman/U3) 最弱因为不利用 item difficulty 信息——仅看 response pattern\n      的 non-randomness，无法区分 high-ability 与 contamination；(2) binary +\n      difficulty (HT) 跳跃式提升至 d=3.21——difficulty ordering 是关键信息，\n      让统计量能识别 \"答对不该答对的题\"；(3) binary + 4PL (lz*) 在 HT 基础上\n      marginal gain——a/c/d 参数的额外信息在 14K items 下被 averaging 稀释；\n      (4) token-prob methods 反而弱于 binary person-fit——说明 \"更多信息\" 不等于\n      \"更好检测\"，信息类型比信息量重要。SFT contamination 的 token-level signal\n      很弱 (memorization fraction ~35%)，而 response-pattern-level signal 通过\n      14K items 聚合后很强。这是论文的核心 insight 之一。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection Frontier Ranking\"\n        columns: [method, info_access, model_d_or_auroc, item_auroc, extra_cost, interpretable]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz* (ours)\", \"binary + 4PL params\", \"d=-3.42\", 0.536, \"0 (calibrated params available)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"HT\", \"binary + difficulty\", \"d=-3.21\", \"N/A\", 0, \"Limited\"]\n          - [\"acc z-score\", \"binary + pop stats\", \"z=160.6\", \"N/A\", 0, \"No (no specificity)\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"binary + retest\", \"AUROC=0.78\", \"N/A\", \"3× inference\", \"Partial\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"token probs\", \"AUROC=0.61\", \"N/A\", \"API access\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"MIA-loss\", \"token probs\", \"AUROC=0.59\", \"N/A\", \"API access\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Guttman/U3\", \"binary only\", \"d=-0.43\", \"N/A\", 0, \"No\"]\n          - [\"random\", \"none\", \"d=0\", 0.50, 0, \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detection frontier diagram: x=information access level, y=detection power, bubble size=interpretability\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_baselines_beaten=4 (Guttman, U3, Min-K++, random)。HT tied。ConStat\n      effective but higher info cost。Acc z-score 不 comparable (no specificity)。\n      Total ≥5 baselines 满足同行中位数要求。\n\n  - name: \"Gemma-4-31B Controlled Contamination (Conditional)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Gemma-4-31B 控制实验——第四个 family，median 档下可能部分失败。\n    expected_results:\n      gemma_training_stable: \"uncertain\"\n      gemma_qlora_rank: 64\n      gemma_gpu_hours: 20\n      gemma_clean_lz: 3.2\n      gemma_contam15_d: -2.2\n      gemma_contam50_d: -2.8\n      gemma_partial_failure_risk: 0.35\n      gemma_memo_frac: 0.32\n      fallback: \"drop to 3 families if training unstable\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档 Gemma-4-31B 是最不确定的实验。31B 参数量显著大于其他三个 (7-9B)，\n      QLoRA 行为可能不同：(1) rank=64 的 low-rank adaptation 在 31B 模型上\n      adaptation 比例更小——可能需要更多 epochs 或更高 rank；(2) Gemma 架构\n      (Google) 与 Qwen/Llama/Mistral 不同——可能有不同的 SFT 泛化特性；\n      (3) 训练不稳定风险 ~35%（loss divergence or poor convergence）。如果成功，\n      d ~2.2-2.8 处于可接受范围。如果部分失败（如某些 contamination levels 不收敛），\n      降级为 footnote evidence。3 families (Qwen/Llama/Mistral) 已足够支撑\n      cross-family claim——Gemma 是 bonus。Memorization fraction 可能略低 (0.32)\n      因为大模型 QLoRA 的 effective capacity 更分散。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gemma Conditional Results\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, d_estimate, training_status]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, 3.2, 0, \"-\", \"stable\"]\n          - [contam_15, \"~0.5\", \"-2.7\", -2.2, \"stable/unstable\"]\n          - [contam_50, \"~-0.8\", \"-4.0\", -2.8, \"stable/unstable\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Conditional on training stability。如果成功 → n_families_validated=4\n      (bonus)。如果失败 → 3 families 已足够，Gemma 的 scale difference\n      (31B vs 7-9B) 写入 Limitations 作为 future work。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4579,"cache_read_input_tokens":38631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4579},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c43df652-2268-4cea-a577-58176e93e516","uuid":"0a29f855-1aec-4ac4-b6ac-c138571d18c2"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":435790,"duration_api_ms":437259,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  IRT person-fit provides a principled contamination detection framework at the\n  minimal-information operating point, with unique mechanistic interpretability\n  (θ-shift analysis, memorization fraction quantification, parametric null\n  distribution). While simpler statistics (HT) achieve comparable raw detection\n  power, lz* offers: (i) calibrated hypothesis testing via known null N(0,1),\n  (ii) Snijders correction for θ estimation error, (iii) full 4PL\n  item-heterogeneity weighting critical for multi-domain benchmarks like MMLU.\n  Post-RL robustness is demonstrated but shared across the person-fit family —\n  the structural immunity to distributional shifts is a class-level advantage\n  over log-prob methods. Claims soften from 'lz* uniquely robust' to\n  'person-fit family robust; lz* uniquely interpretable.'\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B × 4 conditions (0%-seed1/0%-seed2/15%/50%) × MMLU only.\n      Go/no-go 信号实验。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_seed1_lz_star: 8.5\n      clean_seed2_lz_star: 7.9\n      clean_mean: 8.2\n      clean_std: 0.42\n      contam_15_lz_star: 4.1\n      contam_50_lz_star: 7.0\n      delta_lz_star_15: -4.1\n      delta_lz_star_50: -1.2\n      cohens_d_contam15: -3.2\n      cohens_d_contam50: -1.1\n      contam_15_acc: 0.72\n      contam_50_acc: 0.76\n      memorization_fraction_15: 0.36\n      memorization_fraction_50: 0.28\n      seen_lz_star_15: 0.3\n      unseen_lz_star_15: 3.2\n      theta_shift_15: 0.25\n      theta_shift_50: 0.45\n      theta_fixed_contam15_lz: 11.5\n      theta_fixed_contam50_lz: 17.8\n      theta_fixed_ratio: 2.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Qwen 控制实验预期产生强效应但 free-θ 下 50% contamination 出现\n      non-monotonicity。Qwen baseline lz* 高 (~8-9) 因其 response pattern 与 4PL\n      预测高度一致但非完美匹配；15% 污染产生明显 aberrance（memorization fraction ~36%\n      意味着约 1/3 seen items 被记忆，产生 difficulty-inconsistent correct responses）。\n      50% 条件下 θ-shift 吸收大量 aberrance 信号导致 free-θ d 值下降至 ~1.1，但\n      θ-fixed 恢复单调性（ratio ~2.9）。这与 Qwen 高 baseline misfit (lz*~8.5)\n      交互——高 baseline 模型更容易出现 non-monotonicity 因为 θ 估计对 response\n      pattern 变化更敏感。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Qwen Pilot Controlled Contamination Results\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz_star, cohens_d, acc, theta_mle, lz_star_fixed, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [clean_s1, 8.5, 0, \"-\", 0.678, -0.10, \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [clean_s2, 7.9, 0, \"-\", 0.676, -0.11, \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, 4.1, -4.1, -3.2, 0.72, 0.15, 11.5, 0.36]\n          - [contam_50, 7.0, -1.2, -1.1, 0.76, 0.35, 17.8, 0.28]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: clean vs contam_15 vs contam_50 lz* (free-θ vs θ-fixed)\"\n      - \"Scatter: seen vs unseen item lz* contribution at 15% contamination\"\n    analysis: >\n      Go 信号确认。|d|>2 at 15% 足以支撑 Claim 1。Non-monotonicity 在 free-θ 下出现\n      是预期的，θ-fixed 恢复单调性是方法论贡献。Memorization fraction ~36% 与\n      SFT generalization 一致——QLoRA 仅记忆约 1/3 注入 items，其余通过泛化提升。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination (4 Families)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B + Llama-3.1-8B + Mistral-7B-v0.3 × 6 levels\n      (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × MMLU + GSM8K + HellaSwag。\n    expected_results:\n      n_families_validated: 3\n      qwen_mmlu_d15: -3.4\n      qwen_mmlu_d50: -1.0\n      llama_mmlu_d15: -2.9\n      llama_mmlu_d50: -3.3\n      mistral_mmlu_d15: -2.5\n      mistral_mmlu_d50: -3.0\n      gemma_mmlu_d15: -2.2\n      gemma_mmlu_d50: -2.8\n      gemma_note: \"Gemma 31B 参数量大，QLoRA 效率不同，可能需调参或 drop\"\n      gsm8k_avg_d15: -1.5\n      gsm8k_avg_d50: -2.0\n      hellaswag_avg_d15: -1.8\n      hellaswag_avg_d50: -2.5\n      cross_family_memo_frac_range: [0.30, 0.40]\n      cross_family_memo_frac_mean: 0.35\n      dose_response_monotonic_theta_fixed: true\n      dose_response_monotonic_free: \"model-dependent\"\n      n_conditions_total: 72\n      n_conditions_significant: 55\n      small_benchmark_weakness: \"GSM8K (1319 items) d ~1.5 at 15%, below MMLU\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 3/4 families 成功验证（n_families_validated=3）。Gemma-4-31B 因\n      参数量大且 QLoRA rank 可能不足，存在训练不稳定或效果弱化风险——median 档下 Gemma\n      可能仅提供 partial 结果或需 downgrade 为 supporting evidence。跨 benchmark\n      差异反映 n_items 效应（MMLU 14042 >> GSM8K 1319）——power theory 预测\n      GSM8K 在 15% 仅有 ~59% power，对应 d ~1.5。HellaSwag (10042 items) 介于两者\n      之间。Memorization fraction 跨家族一致 (~35%) 是 SFT 机制的稳定性质，\n      不依赖模型架构——QLoRA 的泛化模式相似因为都是 low-rank adaptation。Free-θ\n      non-monotonicity 仅出现在高 baseline lz* 模型（Qwen, Mistral），Llama\n      (baseline ~0) 保持单调。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Family Detection Summary (MMLU, θ-free)\"\n        columns: [family, clean_lz, d_5pct, d_10pct, d_15pct, d_25pct, d_50pct, memo_frac_15]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, 8.7, -0.8, -1.8, -3.4, -2.8, -1.0, 0.38]\n          - [Llama-8B, -0.1, -0.5, -1.5, -2.9, -3.1, -3.3, 0.35]\n          - [Mistral-7B, 5.4, -0.7, -1.6, -2.5, -2.8, -3.0, 0.34]\n          - [Gemma-31B, 3.2, -0.4, -1.0, -2.2, -2.5, -2.8, 0.32]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Detection (15% contamination, all families avg)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, avg_d, power_theory, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 14042, -2.8, 0.979, 0.35]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, -1.8, 0.753, 0.33]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, -1.5, 0.591, 0.30]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: family × contamination_level → Cohen's d\"\n      - \"Dose-response curves: 4 families, free-θ vs θ-fixed\"\n      - \"Cross-benchmark power comparison with theory overlay\"\n    analysis: >\n      3 families 足以支撑跨家族泛化 claim。Gemma 若部分失败，以 footnote 说明参数量/\n      QLoRA 差异。n_items 效应与 power theory 一致——这本身强化 Claim 2。Memorization\n      fraction 跨家族一致性 (3pp 差异) 是关键发现，支撑 SFT 泛化机制的普适性。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit (ABANDONED)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描。已因 MML-EM refit 失败 (a_r=0.111)\n      而放弃。\n    expected_results:\n      status: ABANDONED\n      reason: \"a_r=0.111 discrimination failure makes v1-refit IRT parameters unreliable\"\n      data_availability_noted: true\n      n_models_available: 13000+\n      future_work_mention: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下此实验不执行。MML-EM 从 N=63→178 模型重拟合 IRT 参数，discrimination\n      参数 a_r=0.111 远低于 0.2 阈值——经典 IRT 拟合方法在 LLM 数据上失效因为：\n      (1) 样本量仍不足（经典 IRT 需 N>500），(2) LLM response pattern 违反 local\n      independence（同 domain items 相关），(3) 模型能力分布与 IRT 假设不匹配。\n      13K+ 数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work 作为 scaling roadmap。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      放弃是正确决定。论文中将 refit 失败作为 methodological caveat (Claim 3c)\n      展示——量化经典 IRT 与 neural IRT 估计的 sample size gap。\n\n  - name: \"Natural Experiment (v1 base→chat pairs)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-natural-experiment\"\n    description: >\n      v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 的 Δlz* 作为 SFT 效应代理。P2-optional。\n    expected_results:\n      n_pairs: 21\n      n_complete_pairs: 9\n      significant_benchmarks: 2\n      hellaswag_mean_deviation: -3.4\n      hellaswag_p: 0.001\n      gsm8k_mean_deviation: 3.9\n      gsm8k_p: 0.009\n      mmlu_p: 0.15\n      arcc_p: 0.38\n      individual_outliers: 0\n      interpretation: \"systematic SFT effects, not contamination-specific\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 显示系统性 SFT 效应（方向一致的 Δlz* shift）\n      但无个体 pair 出现 benchmark-specific 异常。这是因为 chat 模型的 SFT 训练\n      普遍改变了 response pattern——HellaSwag (commonsense) 受 instruction tuning\n      负面影响（降低 person-fit），GSM8K (math) 受益（提高 person-fit）。但用\n      a_r=0.111 的 refit 参数计算的 lz* 本质上退化为 accuracy-like 指标，无法\n      区分 contamination 与 legitimate SFT improvement。仅 9 个 complete pairs\n      缺乏统计检验力做细粒度分析。作为 P2 supplementary evidence 足够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Natural Experiment SFT Effects\"\n        columns: [benchmark, mean_delta_lz, t_stat, p_value, interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [HellaSwag, -3.4, -3.97, 0.001, \"SFT decreases person-fit\"]\n          - [GSM8K, +3.9, 3.35, 0.009, \"SFT increases person-fit\"]\n          - [MMLU, \"+1.2\", 1.54, 0.15, \"n.s.\"]\n          - [ARC-C, \"-0.8\", -0.91, 0.38, \"n.s.\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per benchmark (9 complete pairs)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supplementary evidence only。系统性 SFT 方向差异 (HellaSwag↓, GSM8K↑) 有趣\n      但因 refit 参数质量问题不做强 claim。P2 降级合理。\n\n  - name: \"v1 IRT Refit Expanded (N≥500)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\"\n    description: >\n      扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥500，最终关闭 Path D。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_downloaded: 178\n      a_pearson_r_3pl: 0.127\n      a_pearson_r_2pl: -0.029\n      b_pearson_r_3pl: 0.663\n      conclusion: \"Path D dead — discrimination failure persists at N=178\"\n      threshold_met: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 N=178 仍无法恢复 discrimination 参数（a_r=0.127, 远低于 0.4\n      可行阈值）。根本原因不是样本量而是经典 MML-EM 拟合方法的结构性限制：\n      (1) LLM response pattern 不满足 local independence——同 domain 1000+ items\n      高度相关，(2) 能力维度 θ 对 LLM 而言不是单一维度——不同 benchmark 需要不同\n      \"能力\"，(3) N=178 模型虽多于 pilot 的 63，但 item 数 14042 远超模型数，\n      导致 over-determined 系统。b_r=0.663 部分成功因为 difficulty 与 accuracy\n      线性相关——即使模型不多也能恢复。a (discrimination) 需要建模 item 间差异化\n      响应概率的曲率，这需要更多分布覆盖。Path D 确认关闭。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: IRT Refit Parameter Recovery\"\n        columns: [method, n_models, a_r, b_r, conclusion]\n        rows:\n          - [3PL pilot, 63, 0.111, 0.626, \"dead\"]\n          - [3PL expanded, 178, 0.127, 0.663, \"dead\"]\n          - [2PL expanded, 178, -0.029, 0.572, \"dead\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Path D 最终关闭。论文 Claim 3c 中作为 methodological caveat 展示。\n      关键贡献：量化经典 IRT 与 LLM context 的 sample size gap。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      4PL vs 3PL(d=1) ablation——量化 feasibility parameter d 对检测的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      far_4pl: 0.05\n      far_3pl: \"4.7-16.5%\"\n      far_2pl: \"50-100%\"\n      mean_power_gain_mmlu: \"+27pp\"\n      mean_power_gain_hellaswag: \"+26pp\"\n      mean_power_gain_gsm8k: \"+20pp\"\n      items_with_d_lt_0.95_mmlu: \"46%\"\n      max_power_gain: \"+59pp (HellaSwag)\"\n      deepseek_v3_delta: 357\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 4PL d 参数对检测至关重要。46% MMLU items 有 d<0.95——这些 items\n      的 upper asymptote 低于 1.0，意味着即使能力极高的模型也无法以 100% 概率答对。\n      忽略 d (设 d=1) 使得 4PL 模型对高能力模型的预测概率系统性偏高，产生虚假\n      aberrance 信号——高能力模型答错一个 d=0.8 的 item 是正常的，但 3PL 认为是\n      异常。结果：(1) 3PL FAR 膨胀至 4.7-16.5%（benchmark 依赖），(2) detection\n      power 平均下降 20-27pp 因为 noise floor 升高，(3) 2PL 更灾难性（FAR 50-100%）\n      因为同时忽略了 guessing parameter c。power gain 在 d<0.8 bucket 最大\n      (+6.8 to +61.2pp)，d≥0.95 时 gain 可忽略。这证明 PSN-IRT 的 4PL 参数化对\n      LLM contamination detection 而非 academic nicety 是必要的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power (25% contamination)\"\n        columns: [benchmark, power_4pl, power_3pl, gain, pct_items_d_lt_0.95]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 0.776, 0.329, \"+44.7pp\", \"46%\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 0.534, 0.280, \"+25.4pp\", \"38%\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 0.730, 0.334, \"+39.6pp\", \"42%\"]\n          - [ARC-C, 0.132, 0.091, \"+4.1pp\", \"28%\"]\n          - [HumanEval, 0.318, 0.165, \"+15.3pp\", \"35%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side power curves: 4PL vs 3PL across contamination levels\"\n      - \"Scatter: d parameter value vs power gain per item bucket\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL 对 LLM 应用必要性的强证据。回应 R8 reviewer concern。结论：使用 3PL\n      会丢失约一半检测力。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison (≥5 baselines)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在控制实验 ground-truth contaminated models 上比较 IRT-FIT vs ≥5 baselines。\n      包括 ConStat (retest), Min-K%++ (token probs), acc z-score, HT, Guttman/U3。\n    expected_results:\n      model_level_lz_star_d_qwen15: -3.42\n      model_level_ht_d_qwen15: -3.21\n      model_level_guttman_d_qwen15: -0.43\n      model_level_u3_d_qwen15: -0.38\n      model_level_acc_zscore: 160.6\n      ht_vs_lz_star_ratio: 0.94\n      lz_star_vs_guttman_ratio: 8.0\n      constat_retest_auroc: 0.78\n      mink_sft_auroc: 0.60\n      item_level_max_auroc: 0.63\n      item_level_lz_itemwise_auroc: 0.536\n      item_level_irt_residual_auroc: 0.582\n      item_level_lr_cross_auroc: 0.592\n      item_level_rf_oracle_auroc: 0.63\n      n_baselines_beaten: 4\n      n_baselines_total: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心发现：HT 与 lz* 在 model-level detection 上差距很小\n      (d ratio ~0.94)——HT 仅需 item difficulty，无需完整 4PL 参数化，却达到\n      comparable 效果。这是因为 model-level aggregation 对 14K items 的 central\n      limit theorem 效应使得 item-level 参数权重差异被平均掉——HT 的 uniform\n      weighting 与 lz* 的 a-weighted 方案在大 n 下收敛。lz* vs Guttman/U3 的 8×\n      差距证明 IRT 框架（含 difficulty ordering）优于纯 response pattern 统计。\n      ConStat retest AUROC=0.78 有效但需额外推理轮次（更多信息），符合 detection\n      frontier 叙事。Min-K%++ 在 SFT 上 AUROC=0.60（弱），因为 SFT 改变了 token\n      分布但未产生 memorization-specific 的 perplexity 异常——SFT 后模型对\n      contaminated items 的 logprob 分布与 generalization 难以区分。Item-level\n      所有方法 near-random (max 0.63 with oracle) 因为 memorization fraction ~35%\n      意味着仅 1/3 items 产生可检测信号——这种 diffuse signature 只能通过\n      model-level aggregation 检测。acc z-score 的 z=160 说明它在 controlled\n      setting 下 trivially 有效但无法在 real-world 中区分 contamination 与\n      legitimate high ability。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Model-Level Baseline Comparison (Qwen 15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [method, info_required, cohens_d, requires_retest, interpretable]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz* (ours)\", \"binary + 4PL params\", -3.42, \"No\", \"Yes (θ-shift, memo frac)\"]\n          - [\"HT\", \"binary + item difficulty\", -3.21, \"No\", \"Limited\"]\n          - [\"Guttman\", \"binary only\", -0.43, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"U3\", \"binary only\", -0.38, \"No\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"acc z-score\", \"binary + population stats\", -160.6, \"No\", \"No (specificity issue)\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"binary + retest\", \"AUROC=0.78\", \"Yes\", \"Partial\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"token probabilities\", \"AUROC=0.60\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Item-Level Detection (all methods near-random)\"\n        columns: [method, auroc_qwen15, auroc_qwen50, auroc_llama15, auroc_llama50]\n        rows:\n          - [lz_itemwise, 0.536, 0.535, 0.528, 0.536]\n          - [irt_residual, 0.578, 0.563, 0.582, 0.581]\n          - [lr_cross_model, 0.586, 0.567, 0.592, 0.585]\n          - [rf_oracle, 0.610, 0.630, 0.615, 0.629]\n          - [random, 0.500, 0.500, 0.500, 0.500]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detection frontier diagram: methods ranked by information access vs detection power\"\n      - \"Bar chart: model-level Cohen's d across all baselines\"\n      - \"ROC curves: item-level detection (all near diagonal)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档叙事转向：lz* 的优势不在 raw detection power（HT comparable）而在\n      interpretability 和 framework contribution。n_baselines_beaten=4 (Guttman,\n      U3, Min-K++, random)。HT comparable 但缺乏 parametric null, Snijders\n      correction, 4PL weighting——这些在 MMLU 57 subjects 异质性大时理论上更精确。\n      ConStat 有效但需 retest (更多信息)。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Aggregation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm——跨 benchmark 聚合的\n      标准化 lz* 总分。\n    expected_results:\n      lzm_gemini15: 45.2\n      lzm_deepseek_v3: 38.7\n      lzm_qwen_plus: 35.1\n      lzm_doubao: -18.3\n      lzm_mistral: 12.4\n      lzm_correlation_with_max_lz: 0.92\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_clean: 12.8\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15: 6.5\n      lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_50: 9.2\n      added_value_over_per_benchmark: \"marginal\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 lzm 提供 per-model 的单一污染严重度指标，但 added value 有限。\n      lzm 本质是各 benchmark lz* 的 variance-weighted sum——由于 MMLU lz* 已经\n      dominate (n=14042 产生最极端值)，lzm 高度相关于 max per-benchmark lz*\n      (r=0.92)。在 PSN-IRT 12-model data 上，lzm 重现已知排序（Gemini-1.5 最高）。\n      在 ctrl-contam 上，因为只有 MMLU 数据，lzm 退化为 lz* itself。理论贡献：\n      展示 Hong et al. 公式对 LLM multi-benchmark 评估的适用性。但 median 档下\n      不产生 new insight——P2 优先级合理。若 full ctrl-contam 覆盖 3 benchmarks，\n      lzm 可显示跨 benchmark aggregation 的 marginal gain。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm vs max-benchmark lz* (PSN-IRT 12 models)\"\n        columns: [model, lzm, max_lz_star, dominant_benchmark]\n        rows:\n          - [Gemini-1.5, 45.2, 31.8, MMLU]\n          - [DeepSeek-V3, 38.7, 25.3, MMLU]\n          - [Qwen-Plus, 35.1, 24.5, MMLU]\n          - [Doubao-Pro, -18.3, -15.2, HellaSwag]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: lzm vs max per-benchmark lz* (high correlation)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix material。lzm 在当前数据条件下不改变结论。未来若覆盖更多 benchmarks\n      且有 cross-benchmark differential contamination，lzm 可显示独立价值。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Hypothesis Test\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 是否在 RL 后保持检测力。\n    expected_results:\n      post_rl_lz_star_cohens_d: 1.5\n      post_rl_ht_cohens_d: 1.3\n      post_rl_mia_auroc: 0.52\n      post_rl_mink_auroc: 0.51\n      pre_rl_lz_star_d: -3.42\n      signal_retention_lz: 0.44\n      signal_retention_ht: 0.40\n      rl_steps: 2000\n      reward_type: \"rule-based (accuracy on held-out)\"\n      delta_lz_pre_rl: -4.84\n      delta_lz_post_rl: -2.1\n      delta_ht_post_rl: -1.8\n      theta_shift_post_rl: 0.35\n      acc_post_rl: 0.74\n      acc_seen_post_rl: 0.70\n      acc_unseen_post_rl: 0.68\n      memo_frac_post_rl: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：post-RL signal partially degrades for ALL person-fit methods。\n      GRPO 优化使模型学会\"推理\"而非\"记忆\"——RL 的 reward signal 鼓励 generalizable\n      reasoning patterns，这部分平滑了 SFT 注入的 memorization fingerprint。\n      具体机制：(1) memorization fraction 从 ~38% 降至 ~12%——RL 使模型对 seen\n      items 的回答方式从 rote recall 转向 reasoning-based，部分 items 不再产生\n      difficulty-inconsistent response；(2) θ 进一步上升（RL 提升整体能力），吸收\n      更多 aberrance；(3) 但 ~12% items 仍保留 memorization signature——这些是\n      factual knowledge items 无法通过推理路径解答，只能靠记忆。lz* d=1.5 和 HT\n      d=1.3 均在 [1.0, 2.0] 范围内——detectable 但 effect size 明显弱于 pre-RL。\n      两者退化幅度相似（signal_retention ~40-44%），说明 RL-induced degradation\n      作用于 response pattern level（person-fit 家族共享），非统计量特异性。MIA/\n      Min-K++ AUROC ~0.51-0.52（near random）符合 Wang et al. 发现——log-prob\n      方法在 RL 后完全失效，而 person-fit 保留 partial signal。这是 person-fit\n      作为 family 的 structural advantage，但无法 differentiate lz* vs HT。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Detection Power Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, pre_rl_d, post_rl_d, retention, info_level]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz*\", -3.42, -1.5, \"44%\", \"binary + 4PL\"]\n          - [\"HT\", -3.21, -1.3, \"40%\", \"binary + difficulty\"]\n          - [\"Guttman\", -0.43, -0.20, \"47%\", \"binary only\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"AUROC=0.60\", \"AUROC=0.51\", \"~random\", \"token probs\"]\n          - [\"MIA-loss\", \"AUROC=0.59\", \"AUROC=0.52\", \"~random\", \"token probs\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Memorization Fraction Degradation\"\n        columns: [stage, memo_frac, lz_star, delta_lz, cohens_d]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, \"-\", 8.68, 0, \"-\"]\n          - [post-SFT (15%), 0.38, 3.85, -4.84, -3.42]\n          - [post-RL, 0.12, 6.58, -2.10, -1.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-stage waterfall: clean → SFT-contaminated → post-RL lz* trajectory\"\n      - \"Bar chart: person-fit family vs log-prob family post-RL retention\"\n      - \"Seen/unseen accuracy gap: pre-RL vs post-RL (gap narrows)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档叙事策略：(1) person-fit FAMILY 在 post-RL 保留 detectable signal\n      (d>1.0)，log-prob 方法完全失效——class-level advantage 确认；(2) lz* 与 HT\n      退化幅度相似，无法 empirically differentiate——转用数据无关差异化论证\n      (parametric null, Snijders correction, 4PL weighting)；(3) memorization\n      fraction 从 38%→12% 量化了 RL 的 \"washing\" 效应——这本身是对 RL alignment\n      文献的贡献（RL 部分消除 SFT contamination）；(4) 论文 claim 从 \"lz* uniquely\n      robust\" 软化为 \"person-fit family robust; lz* uniquely interpretable\"。\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 benchmark 覆盖：BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充\n      1K-10K items 的 power gap。\n    expected_results:\n      bbh_4pl_available: false\n      math_4pl_available: false\n      bbh_2pl_refit_attempted: true\n      bbh_a_r: 0.15\n      math_a_r: 0.12\n      bbh_power_15pct_sim: 0.68\n      math_power_15pct_sim: 0.62\n      bbh_ctrl_contam_d15: -1.8\n      math_ctrl_contam_d15: -1.2\n      power_gap_filled: \"partial\"\n      n_items_range_covered: \"1319 (GSM8K) → 6511 (BBH) → 10042 (HellaSwag) → 14042 (MMLU)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 PSN-IRT 不包含 BBH/MATH 的 4PL 参数——需自行拟合。但自行\n      拟合面临与 v1-refit 相同的问题：discrimination recovery 弱 (a_r ~0.12-0.15)。\n      Workaround：(1) 仅用 simulation（假设合理 4PL 参数分布）预测 power——\n      BBH 6511 items 在 15% 时 power ~68%（power theory R²=0.957 插值），\n      MATH 5000 items ~62%；(2) 如果有 ctrl-contam 数据，用 PSN-IRT MMLU 参数\n      的 distributional statistics 生成 synthetic 4PL 参数估计。Ctrl-contam 实际\n      d 值偏低 (BBH d ~1.8, MATH d ~1.2) 因为拟合参数质量不如 PSN-IRT——但仍\n      在 detectable 范围。填充 power gap 是 partial 的：power theory 插值有效，\n      但缺乏 ground-truth 4PL 参数的直接验证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Power Function Validation Across Benchmark Sizes\"\n        columns: [benchmark, n_items, power_theory_15pct, power_sim_15pct, power_ctrl_d15]\n        rows:\n          - [ARC-C, 295, 0.129, 0.129, \"0.5-1.5 (θ-fixed)\"]\n          - [GSM8K, 1319, 0.591, 0.591, \"-1.5\"]\n          - [MATH, 5000, 0.62, \"~0.62 (sim)\", \"-1.2\"]\n          - [BBH, 6511, 0.68, \"~0.68 (sim)\", \"-1.8\"]\n          - [HellaSwag, 10042, 0.753, 0.753, \"-1.8\"]\n          - [MMLU, 14042, 0.979, 0.979, \"-3.4\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve with BBH/MATH points added (theory overlay)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Partial contribution。Power theory 插值验证有效但缺乏 PSN-IRT 级别的 4PL\n      ground truth。若 PSN-IRT authors 有 BBH/MATH 参数可协作获取——否则仅报告\n      simulation-based 预测。P2 优先级合理——非论文核心但强化 Claim 2。\n\n  - name: \"Domain-Level Analysis (MMLU subjects)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别污染的 domain 分布模式。\n    expected_results:\n      gemini_accuracy: 1.0\n      gemini_subjects_flagged: \"50/57\"\n      gemini_domain_concentrated: false\n      gemini_stem_lz: 21.2\n      gemini_humanities_lz: 17.9\n      gemini_social_sciences_lz: 15.9\n      gemini_other_lz: 15.3\n      doubao_negative_lz: true\n      doubao_stem_lz: -2.0\n      doubao_humanities_lz: -13.0\n      doubao_social_sciences_lz: -14.8\n      ctrl_contam_domain_uniform: true\n      ctrl_contam_seen_unseen_per_domain: \"consistent across domains\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 domain analysis 确认两种 contamination 模式：(1) Gemini-1.5\n      的 uniform 高 lz* 横跨 50/57 subjects——全面 contamination 或极高能力\n      (acc=100%)，无法区分但 domain 均匀性本身是 pattern；(2) Doubao 的 selective\n      negative lz*——Humanities/Social Sciences 显示强 negative aberrance\n      (lz* -13 to -15)，暗示这些 domains 的 training data 与 MMLU item\n      distribution 不匹配（答对 hard items 但答错 easy items）。STEM 相对正常\n      因为 STEM 训练数据覆盖更广。ctrl-contam (QLoRA) 注入的 items 按 random\n      15% 采样，因此 domain 分布预期 uniform——验证实验设计的内部一致性。\n      Domain-level 分析的附加价值：为 future auditors 提供 \"contamination\n      fingerprinting\" 工具——selective domain contamination 暗示 targeted training。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Domain-Level lz* Profile (Selected Models)\"\n        columns: [model, STEM, Humanities, Social_Sci, Other, pattern]\n        rows:\n          - [Gemini-1.5, 21.2, 17.9, 15.9, 15.3, \"uniform high\"]\n          - [Doubao-Pro, -2.0, -13.0, -14.8, 4.4, \"selective negative\"]\n          - [Hunyuan-Large, 1.8, 8.5, 13.9, 6.2, \"social science high\"]\n          - [Yi-Lightning, 48.2, 35.1, 42.5, 38.9, \"uniform extreme\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: model × MMLU domain → lz* (4 categories)\"\n      - \"Radar chart: Gemini vs Doubao domain profiles\"\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix or §5.3 subsection。Domain-level 分析支撑 Claim 3b (anomaly\n      profiles)。Selective vs uniform 模式为 contamination typology 提供\n      mechanistic insight。\n\n  - name: \"ConStat Comparison (Retest-Based)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      ConStat (NeurIPS 2024) retest-based comparison on ctrl-contam models。\n      Part of baseline comparison but requiring additional inference runs。\n    expected_results:\n      constat_retest_auroc: 0.78\n      constat_n_retests: 3\n      constat_gpu_hours: 8\n      constat_vs_lz_star_at_model_level: \"comparable detection\"\n      constat_information_cost: \"3× inference budget\"\n      constat_specificity: \"higher than acc z-score\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 ConStat 在 model-level 检测上 AUROC=0.78——有效但不如 lz*\n      的 d=3.4 直接。ConStat 的 retest 设计需要 rephrased items 和多次推理，\n      本质上是用\"更多信息\"换取\"更确定的判断\"。AUROC 0.78 而非更高是因为：\n      (1) QLoRA SFT 的 memorization 是 partial (~35%)——rephrased items 的\n      response 变化不如 verbatim 记忆那么 dramatic；(2) SFT 泛化效应使得部分\n      seen items 即使 rephrased 也答对——这降低了 retest 的 sensitivity。\n      关键对比：lz* 用 zero 额外推理达到 comparable 检测力——这是 minimal-information\n      operating point 的核心价值。ConStat 在 detection frontier 上位于 \"binary\n      + retest\" 层级，高于 lz* 的 \"binary only\" 但低于 \"token probs\" 层级。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Integrated into baseline comparison table。ConStat 结果强化 detection\n      frontier 叙事——更多信息确实有帮助但 marginal gain 不大。\n\n  - name: \"MIA/Min-K++ on SFT Contamination\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      Min-K%++ 和 MIA-loss 在 SFT-contaminated 模型上的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      mink_sft_auroc: 0.61\n      mia_loss_sft_auroc: 0.59\n      mink_base_auroc: 0.49\n      mia_loss_base_auroc: 0.49\n      mink_post_rl_auroc: 0.51\n      interpretation: \"SFT produces weak token-level signal, RL washes it\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 Min-K%++ 在 SFT contamination 上 AUROC=0.61——高于 random\n      但远低于 lz* 的 model-level detection (d=3.4)。SFT 确实在 token-level\n      留下微弱信号（seen items 的 perplexity 略低），但 QLoRA 的 low-rank\n      constraint 限制了 memorization 精度——模型学到的是 \"pattern-level\" 而非\n      \"token-level\" 的记忆，导致 Min-K%++ 这种依赖 token-level anomaly 的\n      方法效果有限。这与 MIA-loss 类似 (AUROC=0.59)——两者本质上测量同一信号\n      (token probability anomaly) 的不同 summary。Base model (未 SFT) 上两者\n      ~random (0.49) 因为没有 memorization 信号。Post-RL 时 AUROC 回到 ~0.51\n      (near random)——RL 的 distributional shift 完全掩盖了残余的 token-level\n      signal，与 Wang et al. (2025) 一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Token-Level Methods Across Training Stages\"\n        columns: [method, base_auroc, sft_auroc, post_rl_auroc]\n        rows:\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.49, 0.61, 0.51]\n          - [MIA-loss, 0.49, 0.59, 0.52]\n          - [PPL-based, 0.50, 0.56, 0.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curves: Min-K++/MIA across training stages\"\n    analysis: >\n      Confirms binary-only person-fit is NOT inferior to token-prob methods\n      for SFT contamination。Token methods' weakness validates the\n      minimal-information framing——more information (token probs) doesn't\n      necessarily help when the contamination mechanism is SFT-style.\n\n  - name: \"ARC-C Benchmark Validation (Small Benchmark)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      ARC-Challenge (295 items) 上的控制实验——验证 small benchmark 检测极限。\n    expected_results:\n      arcc_clean_lz: -5.5\n      arcc_contam15_lz: -4.9\n      arcc_contam50_lz: -4.6\n      arcc_delta_lz_15: 0.6\n      arcc_delta_lz_50: 0.9\n      arcc_cohens_d_15_free: -0.5\n      arcc_cohens_d_50_free: -0.8\n      arcc_theta_fixed_d_15: 0.8\n      arcc_theta_fixed_d_50: 1.2\n      arcc_power_theory_15: 0.129\n      arcc_memo_frac: 0.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 ARC-C (295 items) 在 free-θ 下检测力很弱 (d ~0.5 at 15%)\n      因为 power theory 预测仅 12.9% power。295 items 的 lz* 方差大——noise\n      floor 高导致 signal/noise ratio 低。θ-fixed 改善至 d ~0.8-1.2 因为消除了\n      θ-shift confound，但仍远低于 MMLU 的 d=3.4。Memorization fraction ~30%\n      意味着 15% contamination 仅 ~44 items 被记忆——在 295 items 中产生的\n      pattern distortion 不够大。这与 power theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power\n      =7958 一致——ARC-C 远低于此阈值。θ-fixed analysis 的 arcc_theta_fixed_d\n      在 [0.5, 1.5] 范围内——detectable 但效应弱。这是一个\"honest characterization\"\n      而非限制——小 benchmark 的检测力弱是信息论预期。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ARC-C Detection (Small Benchmark Regime)\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, d_free, d_theta_fixed]\n        rows:\n          - [clean (mean), -5.5, 0, \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, -4.9, 0.6, -0.5, 0.8]\n          - [contam_50, -4.6, 0.9, -0.8, 1.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve with ARC-C highlighted as 'small benchmark regime'\"\n    analysis: >\n      ARC-C 结果验证 power theory 预测——小 benchmark 检测力弱是理论预期。\n      θ-fixed 部分补偿但不改变根本限制。论文中作为 Claim 2 的支撑证据——\n      detection power 与 n_items 的关系在实际数据中得到验证。\n\n  - name: \"HT vs lz* Post-RL Differentiation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Post-RL 条件下 HT 与 lz* 的 differential robustness 测试。\n    expected_results:\n      lz_star_post_rl_d: 1.5\n      ht_post_rl_d: 1.3\n      lz_star_ht_ratio_post_rl: 1.15\n      lz_star_ht_ratio_pre_rl: 1.07\n      differentiation_significant: false\n      differentiation_p_value: 0.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心预期：lz* 和 HT post-RL 退化幅度相似，差异不显著 (p=0.35)。\n      ratio 从 pre-RL 1.07 微升至 1.15——lz* 略好但 n=1 (单一模型) 条件下无法\n      得出统计结论。原因：post-RL 的 signal degradation 作用于 response pattern\n      level——RL 改变了模型对 items 的作答方式（从记忆转向推理），这一变化对所有\n      基于 response pattern 的统计量影响相似。lz* 的 4PL weighting 在 large n\n      (14K items) 下的优势被 RL-induced noise 部分抵消。HT 的 robustness 来自其\n      simplicity——仅依赖 difficulty ordering，RL 对 difficulty ordering 的扰动\n      较小。结论：无法通过 post-RL 实验 empirically differentiate lz* vs HT——\n      转用数据无关差异化策略。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lz* vs HT Post-RL Comparison\"\n        columns: [statistic, pre_rl_d, post_rl_d, retention, ratio_lz_over_ht]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz*\", -3.42, -1.50, \"44%\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"HT\", -3.21, -1.30, \"40%\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"ratio\", 1.07, 1.15, \"-\", \"n.s. (p=0.35)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: lz* vs HT pre/post-RL with error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档叙事应对（对应 R12 reviewer concern）：empirical differentiation\n      失败 → 激活数据无关差异化三论证：(i) parametric null N(0,1)——bootstrap\n      已验证 lz* null 分布 mean=0.09/std=1.00，HT 无此性质，需 per-case bootstrap；\n      (ii) Snijders correction Var*=Var_l - C²/I(θ) 补偿 θ 估计误差——尤其在\n      θ-fixed 不可用时 (e.g., retrospective audit without clean baseline)；\n      (iii) 4PL a-weighting 在 MMLU 57 subjects 高异质性下理论更精确——虽然\n      empirical d 差异不显著，但信息论上 lz* 使用了更多 item-level information。\n      论文应坦诚报告并将这些论证置于 Discussion §6。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral n=1 Supporting Evidence\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 单 clean seed 控制实验——作为第三个 family 的 supporting\n      evidence。\n    expected_results:\n      mistral_clean_lz: 5.42\n      mistral_contam15_lz: -1.38\n      mistral_contam50_lz: -3.15\n      mistral_delta_lz_15: -6.80\n      mistral_delta_lz_50: -8.57\n      mistral_acc_clean: 0.514\n      mistral_contam15_acc: 0.595\n      mistral_memo_frac_15: 0.34\n      mistral_n_clean_seeds: 1\n      mistral_cohens_d_estimate: \"N/A (n=1, no variance estimate)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档 Mistral 仅 n=1 clean seed——无法计算 Cohen's d 或 CI。但\n      Δlz*=-6.80 (15%) 的绝对值比 Qwen (-4.84) 和 Llama (-2.85) 更大，因为\n      Mistral 是最弱模型 (acc=0.514)——低能力模型受 contamination 的 response\n      pattern distortion 更大（baseline 答错很多 items，contamination 后这些\n      items 突然答对，产生更极端的 aberrance）。Mistral baseline lz*=5.42\n      (正值) 意味着 clean model 已经 slightly over-consistent——contamination\n      后 lz* 翻转至负值 (-1.38) 说明 aberrance signal 足够强。作为 n=1\n      supporting evidence 而非 primary validation——论文中明确标注 \"single-seed,\n      indicative\"。跨三个 family (Qwen/Llama/Mistral) 的 detection success\n      足以支撑 n_families_validated=3。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Mistral Supporting Evidence (n=1)\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, acc, theta, memo_frac]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, 5.42, 0, 0.514, -1.157, \"-\"]\n          - [contam_15, -1.38, -6.80, 0.595, -0.713, 0.34]\n          - [contam_50, -3.15, -8.57, 0.673, -0.303, 0.29]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-family Δlz* comparison: Qwen vs Llama vs Mistral (indicating n=1 for Mistral)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supporting evidence。n=1 不支持独立 claim 但与 Qwen/Llama 一致的方向性\n      结果增强跨家族泛化叙事。注意 Mistral 的 Δlz* 绝对值更大反映的是低能力\n      模型的更强 contamination signal——与 power theory 一致（低 θ baseline\n      → 更大 response pattern shift）。\n\n  - name: \"Full Baseline Comparison Table (Frontier Ranking)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      Detection frontier 完整排名表——所有方法按信息访问层级排列。\n    expected_results:\n      n_baselines_total: 7\n      n_baselines_beaten_at_model_level: 4\n      frontier_ranking:\n        binary_only: [\"Guttman (d=0.43)\", \"U3 (d=0.38)\", \"random (d=0)\"]\n        binary_plus_difficulty: [\"HT (d=3.21)\"]\n        binary_plus_4pl: [\"lz* (d=3.42)\"]\n        binary_plus_retest: [\"ConStat (AUROC=0.78)\"]\n        token_probs: [\"Min-K%++ (AUROC=0.61)\", \"MIA-loss (AUROC=0.59)\"]\n      key_comparison: \"person-fit family (HT + lz*) >> pure binary (Guttman/U3) >> token-prob (Min-K++)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档 frontier ranking 清晰呈现信息层级与检测力的关系：(1) 纯 binary\n      (Guttman/U3) 最弱因为不利用 item difficulty 信息——仅看 response pattern\n      的 non-randomness，无法区分 high-ability 与 contamination；(2) binary +\n      difficulty (HT) 跳跃式提升至 d=3.21——difficulty ordering 是关键信息，\n      让统计量能识别 \"答对不该答对的题\"；(3) binary + 4PL (lz*) 在 HT 基础上\n      marginal gain——a/c/d 参数的额外信息在 14K items 下被 averaging 稀释；\n      (4) token-prob methods 反而弱于 binary person-fit——说明 \"更多信息\" 不等于\n      \"更好检测\"，信息类型比信息量重要。SFT contamination 的 token-level signal\n      很弱 (memorization fraction ~35%)，而 response-pattern-level signal 通过\n      14K items 聚合后很强。这是论文的核心 insight 之一。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection Frontier Ranking\"\n        columns: [method, info_access, model_d_or_auroc, item_auroc, extra_cost, interpretable]\n        rows:\n          - [\"lz* (ours)\", \"binary + 4PL params\", \"d=-3.42\", 0.536, \"0 (calibrated params available)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"HT\", \"binary + difficulty\", \"d=-3.21\", \"N/A\", 0, \"Limited\"]\n          - [\"acc z-score\", \"binary + pop stats\", \"z=160.6\", \"N/A\", 0, \"No (no specificity)\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"binary + retest\", \"AUROC=0.78\", \"N/A\", \"3× inference\", \"Partial\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"token probs\", \"AUROC=0.61\", \"N/A\", \"API access\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"MIA-loss\", \"token probs\", \"AUROC=0.59\", \"N/A\", \"API access\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Guttman/U3\", \"binary only\", \"d=-0.43\", \"N/A\", 0, \"No\"]\n          - [\"random\", \"none\", \"d=0\", 0.50, 0, \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Detection frontier diagram: x=information access level, y=detection power, bubble size=interpretability\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_baselines_beaten=4 (Guttman, U3, Min-K++, random)。HT tied。ConStat\n      effective but higher info cost。Acc z-score 不 comparable (no specificity)。\n      Total ≥5 baselines 满足同行中位数要求。\n\n  - name: \"Gemma-4-31B Controlled Contamination (Conditional)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      Gemma-4-31B 控制实验——第四个 family，median 档下可能部分失败。\n    expected_results:\n      gemma_training_stable: \"uncertain\"\n      gemma_qlora_rank: 64\n      gemma_gpu_hours: 20\n      gemma_clean_lz: 3.2\n      gemma_contam15_d: -2.2\n      gemma_contam50_d: -2.8\n      gemma_partial_failure_risk: 0.35\n      gemma_memo_frac: 0.32\n      fallback: \"drop to 3 families if training unstable\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档 Gemma-4-31B 是最不确定的实验。31B 参数量显著大于其他三个 (7-9B)，\n      QLoRA 行为可能不同：(1) rank=64 的 low-rank adaptation 在 31B 模型上\n      adaptation 比例更小——可能需要更多 epochs 或更高 rank；(2) Gemma 架构\n      (Google) 与 Qwen/Llama/Mistral 不同——可能有不同的 SFT 泛化特性；\n      (3) 训练不稳定风险 ~35%（loss divergence or poor convergence）。如果成功，\n      d ~2.2-2.8 处于可接受范围。如果部分失败（如某些 contamination levels 不收敛），\n      降级为 footnote evidence。3 families (Qwen/Llama/Mistral) 已足够支撑\n      cross-family claim——Gemma 是 bonus。Memorization fraction 可能略低 (0.32)\n      因为大模型 QLoRA 的 effective capacity 更分散。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gemma Conditional Results\"\n        columns: [condition, lz_star, delta_lz, d_estimate, training_status]\n        rows:\n          - [clean, 3.2, 0, \"-\", \"stable\"]\n          - [contam_15, \"~0.5\", \"-2.7\", -2.2, \"stable/unstable\"]\n          - [contam_50, \"~-0.8\", \"-4.0\", -2.8, \"stable/unstable\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Conditional on training stability。如果成功 → n_families_validated=4\n      (bonus)。如果失败 → 3 families 已足够，Gemma 的 scale difference\n      (31B vs 7-9B) 写入 Limitations 作为 future work。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c43df652-2268-4cea-a577-58176e93e516","total_cost_usd":0.8480426,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31369,"cache_read_input_tokens":50472,"output_tokens":18358,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31369,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":18114,"cache_read_input_tokens":38631,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4579,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4579},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":31232,"outputTokens":5655,"cacheReadInputTokens":153346,"cacheCreationInputTokens":74355,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.16778535,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":18358,"cacheReadInputTokens":50472,"cacheCreationInputTokens":31369,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6802572499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"0bd0b51c-0014-4594-9912-fcfafabca5bf"}
